== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From 3. person form of ''[[tala#Icelandic|[að] tala]]'' "[[talk|[to] talk]]" (= ''[[talar|[þú] talar]]'', "[[speak|[you] speak]]") + ''[[þú#Icelandic|þú]] "[[you]]" + {{singular}} {{acc}} of ''[[þýska]]'' meaning "[[German]]" (=''[[þýsku]]''). Literally meaning "[you] speak you German?" or "you speak German"? 

=== Phrase ===
'''[[tala#Icelandic|talar]] [[þú#Icelandic|þú]] [[þýska#Icelandic|þýsku]]?'''

# [[do you speak German]]?

